    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>On solving above curve we get intersecting point as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on plotting the diagram of the given curves we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6d9b522a-6fb5-47f7-b02d-c0186ce2e87b-9889862.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 208px;\" /></p><p>Required area</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup></math></p